// EXPECT-ERROR: the local one in err-expect-local.momo is private to that file and cannot answer it
// A local routine cannot answer an expect: the library's call looks in its own
// file and then in the program's, and never in this file's privates (§73). The
// error lands in the library, so there is no EXPECT-AT here.
include "inc/expects.momo"

local sub show( u16 y, a16 at, u16 n ) { }
u16 nextKey() => 1

libDraw()
